<programme start="20261121141700 +0000" stop="20261121171900 +0000" channel="-ActionMax (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Horizon: An American Saga: Chapter 1</title><desc lang="en">In 1859 families discover the lure of the Old West as they settle in territories from Wyoming to Kansas. Meanwhile, a gruff cowboy soon finds himself on the run with a prostitute and a young boy after killing a fellow gunman.</desc><credits><actor>Kevin Costner</actor><actor>Sienna Miller</actor><actor>Sam Worthington</actor></credits><date>20240101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Western</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p26243674_i_h8_ad.jpg"/></programme>
