<programme start="20261121120000 +0000" stop="20261121150000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Clemson at Duke</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Clemson Tigers visit the Duke Blue Devils for an NCAA Division I FBS conference matchup. Clemson lost 20-6 to Georgia Tech on November 14 with Tait Reynolds, while Duke lost 36-25 to Miami on November 14 with Walker Eget in ACC.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
