<programme start="20261121170000 +0000" stop="20261121200000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Syracuse at Boston College</sub-title><desc lang="en">Fresh off a victory, Syracuse (5-5, 3-5 ACC) takes on Boston College (4-6, 2-4) at Alumni Stadium in Chestnut Hill. Boston College seeks to snap a three-game skid after falling 41-7 to Notre Dame. Syracuse beat NC State 34-31 behind Steve Angeli.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
