<programme start="20261122180200 +0000" stop="20261122190200 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">Fear the Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">La puerta</sub-title><desc lang="es">Una reunión con un viejo amigo ayuda a John Dorie a salir del estado de angustia en el que se encontraba. De vuelta en Lawton, Virginia exige respuestas.</desc><credits><director>Michael Satrazemis</director><actor>Lennie James</actor><actor>Alycia Debnam-Carey</actor><actor>Maggie Grace</actor><actor>Colman Domingo</actor><actor>Danay Garcia</actor><actor>Garret Dillahunt</actor><actor>Austin Amelio</actor><actor>Alexa Nisenson</actor><actor>Karen David</actor><actor>Jenna Elfman</actor><actor>Ruben Blades</actor><actor>Mo Collins</actor><actor>Colby Hollman</actor><actor>Zoe Colletti</actor><actor>Daryl Mitchell</actor><actor>Colby Minifie</actor><actor>Craig Nigh</actor></credits><date>20210411</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">5.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S06E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/ac7dc33e91eb55db2f181df276ff6fdd0dd72c2d.JPEG"/></programme>
