<programme start="20261121180700 +0000" stop="20261121183700 +0000" channel="Captain Tsubasa"><title lang="es">Captain Tsubasa LATAM</title><sub-title lang="es">El fénix Tsubasa</sub-title><desc lang="es">Tras una aplastante desventaja, Tsubasa decide arriesgarlo todo: intentará el famoso tiro con efecto de Roberto por la oportunidad de ganar.</desc><date>00010101</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.41.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E42</episode-num><rating><value>PG</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/646bcdf917da09001a32ae02/tile_1769546521026.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121183700 +0000" stop="20261121190700 +0000" channel="Captain Tsubasa"><title lang="es">Captain Tsubasa LATAM</title><sub-title lang="es">El tigre caído</sub-title><desc lang="es">En las semifinales del Torneo, los primeros en batirse son Meiwa y Toho. Con Hyuga en el banco, Meiwa saca ventaja, haciendo sufrir a Takeshi Sawada.</desc><date>00010101</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.42.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E43</episode-num><rating><value>PG</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/646bcdf917da09001a32ae02/tile_1769546521026.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
