<programme start="20261121220300 +0000" stop="20261121223300 +0000" channel="Captain Tsubasa"><title lang="es">Captain Tsubasa LATAM</title><sub-title lang="es">Una feroz batalla</sub-title><desc lang="es">Nankatsu y Toho anotan tres goles cada uno. Una falta de Takasugi le regala un tiro libre a Hyuga, quien se dispone a usar su poderoso tiro de tigre.</desc><date>00010101</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.49.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E50</episode-num><rating><value>PG</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/646bcdf917da09001a32ae02/tile_1769546521026.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
