<programme start="20261121170000 +0000" stop="20261121203000 +0000" channel="FOX 23 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Ohio State at Nebraska</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 14 Buckeyes (7-3, 5-2 Big Ten) face the Cornhuskers (6-4, 3-4) at Memorial Stadium. Ohio State enters after a 28-19 victory against Northwestern behind Luke Fahey, while Nebraska snapped a skid and beat Rutgers for a shutout 31-0 win.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121203000 +0000" stop="20261122000000 +0000" channel="FOX 23 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Texas Tech at Baylor</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Baylor Bears host the No. 12 Texas Tech Red Raiders at McLane Stadium in a Big 12 matchup. Texas Tech aims for a four-game win streak after defeating Oklahoma State 52-27, while Baylor broke a two-game win streak with a 28-7 loss against BYU.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
