<programme start="20261122000000 +0000" stop="20261122010000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Ice Airport Alaska</title><sub-title lang="en">Fuel&apos;s Gold</sub-title><desc lang="en">Father-son aviators battle turbulence to refuel a remote mine, bush pilots fight an aerial jam to reach Alaska&apos;s biggest sled race, and the Coastguard turn a C-130 into a bomber to drop supplies on an isolated beach.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18864180_b_v11_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122010000 +0000" stop="20261122020000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Ice Airport Alaska</title><sub-title lang="en">Bear Knuckle Flight</sub-title><desc lang="en">Fish and Wildlife aviators battle Arctic conditions to track down a polar bear population; a bush pilot races fading daylight to save a business; Anchorage field crews battle to clear an icy runway; CBP officers investigate suspicious cargo.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18864180_b_v11_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122020000 +0000" stop="20261122030000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Ice Airport Alaska</title><sub-title lang="en">To The Ends Of The Earth</sub-title><desc lang="en">Pilots fly over the dangerous Brooks Mountains, so engineers can fix a remote weather station; a veteran pilot tests a rookie on their bush plane landings; crews fight ice and wind to save a winter festival; engineers race to repair a 737.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18864180_b_v11_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122030000 +0000" stop="20261122040000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Ice Airport Alaska</title><sub-title lang="en">Live and Let Fly</sub-title><desc lang="en">A lone bush pilot races to stock ultra-marathon checkpoints; a heli pilot risks a sling-load at 4,000 feet and comes inches from disaster; a vintage DC-3 plane is a village&apos;s only lifeline as a storm closes in.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18864180_b_v11_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122040000 +0000" stop="20261122050000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Ice Airport Alaska</title><sub-title lang="en">The Cold Hard Count</sub-title><desc lang="en">Witness wild weather, emergency landings, and animal invaders at Ted Stevens International Airport in Anchorage, Alaska, one of the world&apos;s busiest cargo airports.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18864180_b_v11_ad.jpg"/></programme>
