<programme start="20261121210000 +0000" stop="20261121220000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Comienzan los ataques</sub-title><desc lang="es">Yusuf y sus hombres atacan a Josué, él lucha contra ellos y gana la batalla. Acán ayuda a Yusuf a escapar y decide aliarse con él para derrotar a Josué.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261121</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.88.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E89</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/378ab14ed6f6d507e03d0ba6fe8895a1.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121220000 +0000" stop="20261121230000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Odio y amor</sub-title><desc lang="es">Arauto ayuda a Tileia a conseguir mucha comida para ella y la gente del pueblo. Jéssica le dice a Rahab que no permitirá que ella esté con Salmón.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261121</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.89.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E90</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/8ba67792e239bd5d2299aeddaa4c7cf4.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121230000 +0000" stop="20261122000000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Pócima mortal</sub-title><desc lang="es">Sama no puede ocultar la profunda tristeza que siente al ver que Boan se casa con Ruth. Samara besa a Abel frente a Josué y Aruna. Yussuf está decidido a asesinar a Melina por humillarlo en su boda.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20180124</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.90.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E91</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/546e7ebb7dabc7d2c0650ab12ecfd2e8.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122000000 +0000" stop="20261122010000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Una hermosa mujer</sub-title><desc lang="es">Yusuf trata de asesinar a Najara por humillarlo, pero ella logra seducirlo. Rahab le dice a su madre que sabe que Salomón la quiere.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20180125</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.91.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E92</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/19b291ee23f837e2b2d2b010100aee55.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122010000 +0000" stop="20261122020000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Noche de bodas</sub-title><desc lang="es">Samara tiene un nuevo pretendiente, pero ella sigue obsesionada en tener el amor de Josué. Yusuf se disfraza y quiere investigar a Josué y su pueblo para atacarlos.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20180126</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.92.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E93</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/1d43c0a999cc02c6f6d4e6fe201999e7.jpeg"/></programme>
