<programme start="20261122020000 +0000" stop="20261122030000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Natanael entra a escondidas a la casa de Clara y apunta con una pistola a María Elizabeth. Adriana se entera por Clara de que ella es su hermana.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20231115</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.57.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E58</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/703889dff73751b3c6ceea2dc7e9aa7b.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122030000 +0000" stop="20261122040000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">María Elizabeth trata de convencer a Adriana de que la idea que tiene de su abuelo está equivocada. Clara recibe un citatorio para la audiencia.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20200116</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.58.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E59</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/a6dfbd4d31b749f491b073d0d62c91b0.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122040000 +0000" stop="20261122050000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">María Elizabeth le cuenta a Henrique que Natanael también involucró a Joana en la historia con Renan. Amaro le pide matrimonio a Estela.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20200117</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.59.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E60</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/cfdb3f0b23ee14563125ddf72a64d3cf.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122050000 +0000" stop="20261122060000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Sofía espía a Mariano para averiguar quién es su nueva conquista, sin sospechar que se trata de su hija Livia.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20200120</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.60.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E61</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/ce4486f3c0822d23bfb6f8775c71691a.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122060000 +0000" stop="20261122070000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">Raquel puede quedar parapléjica. Juvenal le pide a Cándida que se case con él por despecho. Leandra ofrece a Cleo un trabajo en el burdel.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20231121</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.61.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E62</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/0829e68195074808b548d0cc807c6925.jpeg"/></programme>
